<title>FRANCE: Carrefour H1 sales up 8.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Carrefour H1 sales up 8.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					89,346	up 8.8 pct</p>
<p>     - in France				  50,650	up 3.4 pct</p>
<p>    June turnover				 14,689	up 5.5 pct</p>
<p>     - in France				   8,261    down 0.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Carrefour gave its six-month sales in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it opened a 14th store in Taiwan last month, a 14th store in Mexico and two in Thailand for a total of five in that country.	   -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
